    <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase 1 Final: Combines counter elimination with RocksDB best practices</para>
<para>Key optimizations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Thread-local work_id (no shared counter)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>allow_concurrent_memtable_write = true</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>enable_pipelined_write = true <linebreak/>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>allow_unordered_write = true</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>WAL disabled for benchmarks</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Expected: Better scaling than baseline </para>
    </detaileddescription>
